    "title": "Holbrook Celebrates Completion of $2.1M Business Route 40 Pavement Upgrade by ADOT - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Steve Wilson ,\n8 hours ago Drivers and local businesses in Holbrook are experiencing smoother rides and sidewalks following a pavement upgrade on a critical section of Business Route 40. The Arizona Department of Transportation (ADOT) has completed a $2.1 million improvement project on the mile-long stretch known as Navajo Boulevard, effectively rejuvenating a main artery that not only connects over 50 businesses but also serves as a link to Interstate 40 and the Navajo Nation. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
